    "make_it":  [
                    "Brown the ground beef in a little olive oil in a large skillet, breaking it up as it cooks, then drain any grease.",
                    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and stir for about a minute.",
                    "Whisk together the soy sauce, honey, hoisin sauce, sesame oil, rice vinegar, red pepper flakes, and black pepper, pour it into the skillet, and let it bubble into a glaze.",
